    "liuxy951129-cpu/humanizer-zh": {
      "source_tree_sha256": "7d2555041f7410ed4fc8c9144caccb80c24b13d7b72ba08f5fded7abde63d9e6",
      "reviewer_kind": "assistant_source_review",
      "reviewer_id": "calibration-source-screening-agent",
      "decision": "include",
      "reason": "Source-only review confirms two distinct material workflow features and available own-source content with exact physical quotations. Target outputs, registry scores, scan labels, gold judgments, and DOE conclusions were not used.",
      "features": [
        {
          "feature": "versions_or_transformations",
          "reason": "The editing procedure identifies AI-style patterns, rewrites the affected passages, and retains the original meaning and intended tone in a distinct edited version.",
          "evidence": [
            {
              "path": "SKILL.md",
              "start_line": 24,
              "end_line": 30,
              "quote": "当收到需要人性化处理的文本时：\n\n1. **识别 AI 模式** - 扫描下面列出的模式\n2. **重写问题片段** - 用自然的替代方案替换 AI 痕迹\n3. **保留含义** - 保持核心信息完整\n4. **维持语调** - 匹配预期的语气（正式、随意、技术等）\n5. **注入灵魂** - 不仅要去除不良模式，还要注入真实的个性"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "feature": "conditions_or_retries",
          "reason": "The edited result is scored across five dimensions, and a total below 35 requires another revision. This is the source writing workflow, not a DOE scoring judgment.",
          "evidence": [
            {
              "path": "SKILL.md",
              "start_line": 440,
              "end_line": 456,
              "quote": "## 质量评分\n\n对改写后的文本进行 1-10 分评估（总分 50）：\n\n| 维度 | 评估标准 | 得分 |\n|------|----------|------|\n| **直接性** | 直接陈述事实还是绕圈宣告？<br>10 分：直截了当；1 分：充满铺垫 | /10 |\n| **节奏** | 句子长度是否变化？<br>10 分：长短交错；1 分：机械重复 | /10 |\n| **信任度** | 是否尊重读者智慧？<br>10 分：简洁明了；1 分：过度解释 | /10 |\n| **真实性** | 听起来像真人说话吗？<br>10 分：自然流畅；1 分：机械生硬 | /10 |\n| **精炼度** | 还有可删减的内容吗？<br>10 分：无冗余；1 分：大量废话 | /10 |\n| **总分** |  | **/50** |\n\n**标准：**\n- 45-50 分：优秀，已去除 AI 痕迹\n- 35-44 分：良好，仍有改进空间\n- 低于 35 分：需要重新修订"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source_closure": {
        "status": "complete_for_static_audit",
        "reason": "SKILL.md and README.md supply the complete editing procedure, pattern descriptions, examples, and revision criteria. Input text is runtime data. Referenced upstream style guides are attribution/background, not a mandatory missing own implementation.",
        "local_reference_decisions": []
      }
    },
    "financial-ai-analyst/mx-macro-data": {
      "source_tree_sha256": "df3a2790210529da2c3891d50058c008a89e674545f0b5067a231d3fdf49d6e6",
      "reviewer_kind": "assistant_source_review",
      "reviewer_id": "calibration-source-screening-agent",
      "decision": "include",
      "reason": "Source-only review confirms two distinct material workflow features and available own-source content with exact physical quotations. Target outputs, registry scores, scan labels, gold judgments, and DOE conclusions were not used.",
      "features": [
        {
          "feature": "versions_or_transformations",
          "reason": "The planner reads each output CSV and computes a distinct set of missing region-indicator pairs separately for each frequency.",
          "evidence": [
            {
              "path": "SKILL.md",
              "start_line": 82,
              "end_line": 89,
              "quote": "#### **阶段 B: 文件读取与差异检测 (File Reading   & Gap Detection)**\n1.  **获取输出文件列表**：获取 `mx_macro_data` 生成的所有 CSV 文件路径。\n2.  **读取并分析每个文件**：\n    - 使用规划引擎内置的代码执行能力（如 Python Sandbox）读取 CSV。\n    - 提取每个文件中实际覆盖的 `(地区, 指标)` 组合及其数量。\n3.  **执行差异计算**：\n    - 对**每一种频率**的文件，分别计算 `Missing_Pairs_<Frequency> = Expected_Universe - Actual_From_CSV_File`。\n    - 识别出具体缺失的项（如：年频数据中缺失“西藏-GDP”）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "feature": "conditions_or_retries",
          "reason": "The planner stops when no pairs are missing, otherwise issues completion queries and repeats gap detection until complete or five retries are reached.",
          "evidence": [
            {
              "path": "SKILL.md",
              "start_line": 95,
              "end_line": 114,
              "quote": "1.  **判断是否需要补全**：\n    - 如果所有频率的 `Missing_Pairs` 集合均为空：**结束流程**，交付现有文件。\n    - 如果存在非空的 `Missing_Pairs` 集合：**必须进入补全流程**，不可跳过。\n\n2.  **构建补全查询**：\n    - 根据 `Missing_Pairs_<Frequency>` 中的缺失项，结合原始查询的时间维度，构造新的自然语言查询。\n    - **示例**：\n      ```\n      Missing_Pairs_季 = [(\"西藏\", \"GDP\"), (\"宁夏\", \"GDP\")]\n      ↓\n      补全查询 = \"查询西藏自治区、宁夏回族自治区的 GDP 季度数据，时间范围同前次查询\"\n      ```\n\n3.  **再次调用 `mx_macro_data`**：\n    - 使用新构造的补全查询，再次调用本 Skill 获取缺失数据。\n\n4.  **迭代循环**：\n    - 重复执行 **阶段 B（差异检测）→ 阶段 C（决策补全）**，直至满足以下任一条件：\n      - ✅ 所有频率下的缺失项均已补全\n      - ⚠️ 达到最大重试次数5次，此时应向用户报告未能补全的数据项"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source_closure": {
        "status": "complete_for_static_audit",
        "reason": "The invoked scripts/get_data.py is retained. The multi-step gap-detection and completion policy is explicitly supplied in SKILL.md. Service behavior, API credentials, query intents, CSV outputs, and user-side planner execution are external/runtime interfaces; the apparent local-path nomination is a regex character class.",
        "local_reference_decisions": [
          {
            "target": "scripts/[^）",
            "classification": "illustrative_or_optional",
            "reason": "The cited content is a regular-expression character class in _extract_frequency, not a local source-file reference.",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "path": "scripts/get_data.py",
                "start_line": 113,
                "end_line": 113,
                "quote": "    match = re.search(r'[（(]([^）)]+)[）)]', entity_name)"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
